{"study_accession":"PRJNA962490","secondary_study_accession":"SRP434833","title":"Dysfunctional effector memory CD8 T cells in the bronchoalveolar compartment of people living with HIV","description":"Mechanisms by which HIV causes susceptibility to respiratory pathogens remain incompletely understood. We obtained whole blood and bronchoalveolar lavage (BAL) from people with latent TB infection in the presence or absence of ARV-naïve HIV co-infection. Transcriptomic and flow cytometric analyses demonstrated HIV-associated cell proliferation and type I interferon activity in blood and effector memory CD8 T-cells in BAL. Both compartments displayed reduced induction of CD8 T cell-related IL-17A in people with HIV, associated with elevated T cell regulatory molecule expression. We propose dysfunctional CD8 T cell responses in uncontrolled HIV contribute to susceptibility to secondary bacterial infections, including tuberculosis. Overall design: Transcriptional profilling of 10 pairs of blood and BAL samples from people living with HIV and those without HIV","pubmed":"39563891","geo_series":"","n_samples":16,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN34403334","study_accession":"PRJNA962490","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"batch-2_0099-P","description":"batch-2_0099-P","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7233332","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2025-01-29","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["tissue","PBMC"],["patient id","0099"],["disease","LTBI and HIV-positive"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR24322767","experiment_accession":"SRX20117287","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":19108978,"base_count":2904564656,"first_public":"2025-01-29","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM7233332: batch-2_0099-P Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN34403349","study_accession":"PRJNA962490","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"bat